(d) FITS-2 on PumpSwap: C's pool with as much third-party LP again (lambda 50 %), which the attacker holds; a
position at the cap or half of it (#106 sizes on D: half and a quarter of #105's cap, the same positions);
flat 30 s, then a genuine pump to a hold level just below the honest threshold (healthy at the pool's depth).
From its first second the attacker sends [withdraw all, crank_price, deposit] (the withdraw drag: its
attacker-only seconds pull L_ema to D) and [withdraw all, liquidate, deposit] every second.  The liquidation
spot leg at L_live (#100) or at max(L_live, L_ema') (FITS-2 (a), #101), each with the #99 keeper (per second
only near a threshold, else every 30 s) or the #101 keeper (FITS-2 (b): per second for 10 s after a foreign
bucket liquidity, extended while it recurs); every column with #106's D rules.  Cells: the attacked outcome
